agent_connected = manager:/var/ossec/logs/alerts/alerts.log : CONTAINS : New ossec agent connected.
sql_injection = manager:/var/ossec/logs/alerts/alerts.log : CONTAINS : SQL injection attempt
fail_login_user = manager:/var/ossec/logs/alerts/alerts.log : CONTAINS : 3 failed logins in a short period of time
cpu_high = manager:/var/ossec/logs/alerts/alerts.log : CONTAINS : CPU usage metrics
process_not_running = manager:/var/ossec/logs/alerts/alerts.log : CONTAINS : Important process not running
block_user = server:/var/ossec/logs/active-responses.log : CONTAINS : /var/ossec/active-response/bin/disable-account.sh add
block_ip = server:/var/ossec/logs/active-responses.log : CONTAINS : /var/ossec/active-response/bin/firewall-drop.sh add
